        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "There are serious allegations of high crimes and misdemeanors.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The Oversight Committee is conducting similar investigations.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "All individuals who have taken an oath of office should take the rule of law seriously.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
