    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84257.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 31,
    "turn_text": "Well, one thing we know is that we are not going to sink to the GOP standard of impeachment, which is you can impeach the President of the United States and absorb everybody's energy and attention for a year or two years over private",
